OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night blaze burns 'several
OL,4,Atonnes' of hay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire involving "several tonnes"
OL,7,Fof hay bales broke out at a farm on
OL,8,FBonfire Night.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to the incident, near Storrs
OL,12,FMill Lane in Barnsley, shortly after
OL,13,F02:00 GMT.
OL,15,FFive fire engines were sent to the
OL,16,Fscenes and crews remained at the farm
OL,17,Flater on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
