OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night blaze burns 'several
OL,4,Atonnes' of hay
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the service said:
OL,7,F"Firefighters have been tackling a
OL,8,Fblaze involving several tonnes of
OL,9,Fwrapped hay bales in Cudworth, Barnsley
OL,10,Fsince the early hours of this morning."
